| package |
package := Package name: 'MySQL'.
package paxVersion: 1;
	basicComment: 'MySQL for Dolphin
Native (non-ODBC) MySQL interface for Dolphin Smalltalk.

Based on the Pharo implementation from https://github.com/pharo-rdbms

https://github.com/rko281/MySQL'.

